			.internalConfigurationsUrl(internalConfigurationsUrl)
			.extraConfigurationsUrl(extraConfigurationsUrl)
			.personalQuotionUrl(personalQuotionUrl)
			.baseConstructionDrawUrl(baseConstructionDrawUrl)
			.decorateRuleUrl(urls)
			.ownerAddress(ownerAddress)
			.constructionDrawMode(constructionDrawMode)
			.secondDrawModeName(secondDrawModeName)
			.afterDiscountDesignerAmount(afterDiscountDesignerAmount)
			.agentIdNo(cipherService.decrypt(agentIdNo))
			.agentPhone(cipherService.decrypt(agentPhone))
			.customerIdNo(cipherService.decrypt(customerIdNo))
			.companyName(companyInfoDTO.getCompanyName())
			.companyAddress(companyInfoDTO.getCompanyAddress())
			.companyPhone(companyInfoDTO.getCompanyPhone())
			.companySealCode(companyInfoDTO.getCompanySealCode())
			.companyBank(companyInfoDTO.getCompanyBank())
			.companyAccount(companyInfoDTO.getCompanyAccount())
			.beforeDeliveryDaysToWork(beforeDeliveryDaysToWork)
			.otherGuaranteeYear(otherGuaranteeYear)
			.waterElectricGuaranteeYear(waterElectricGuaranteeYear)
			.waterProofGuaranteeYear(waterProofGuaranteeYear)
			.firstPayAmountText(firstPayAmountText)
			.secondPayAmountText(secondPayAmountText)
			.thirdPayAmountText(thirdPayAmountText)
			.firstPayAmount(firstPayAmount)
			.secondPayAmount(secondPayAmount)
			.thirdPayAmount(thirdPayAmount)
			.taxRate(taxRate)
			.disputeDealMode(disputeDealMode)
			.materialList(JsonUtil.toJsonString(materialItemList))
			.partRoomRange(partRoomRange)
			.build();


		if (Objects.nonNull(planAllDTO) && Objects.nonNull(planAllDTO.getPlanInfo())) {
			formalPackageContractFreeformDTO.setContractAmount(String.valueOf(planAllDTO.getPlanInfo().getContractPriceTotal()));
			formalPackageContractFreeformDTO.setContractAmountText(new MoneyConvertUtil(String.valueOf(planAllDTO.getPlanInfo().getContractPriceTotal())).convert());
			formalPackageContractFreeformDTO.setQuotationTotalAmount(String.valueOf(planAllDTO.getPlanInfo().getQuotePrice()));
			formalPackageContractFreeformDTO.setPackageName(planAllDTO.getPlanInfo().getComboName());

		}
		LOGGER.info("formalPackageContractFreeformDTO:{}", JsonUtil.toJsonString(formalPackageContractFreeformDTO));
		return formalPackageContractFreeformDTO;
	}


	public void submitCheck(ZqContractReq body, List<ZqContractPartEnum> partEnumList) {
		Byte type = body.getType();
		ProjectInfoDTO projectInfoDTO = projectInfoReadService.getByProjectOrderIdWithoutCache(body.getProjectOrderId());
		byte businessType = commonContractService.getBusinessType(projectInfoDTO);

		if (Objects.isNull(type) || !ContractTypeEnum.getMap().containsKey(type)) {
			//1.认购合同 2.设计合同 3.套餐正式合同 4.套餐变更协议
			throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_PARAM_ILLEGAL, "提交合同，合同类型参数校验失败-[签约]");
		}

		//签约主体
		if (partEnumList.contains(ZqContractPartEnum.SIGN_OBJECT_INFO)) {
			if (Objects.isNull(body.getSignTypeInfo())) {
				throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_PARAM_ILLEGAL, "缺少签约方式模块 - 参数校验失败");
			}
			if (Objects.isNull(body.getSignTypeInfo().getContractObjectType())) {
				throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_PARAM_ILLEGAL, "主体类型不能为空 - 参数校验失败");
			}
			if (!ContractObjectTypeEnum.getCodes().contains(body.getSignTypeInfo().getContractObjectType())) {
				throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_PARAM_ILLEGAL, "主体类型: 值非法 - 参数校验失败");
			}
			if (Objects.isNull(body.getSignTypeInfo().getSignChannelType())) {
				throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_PARAM_ILLEGAL, "主体形式不能为空 - 参数校验失败");
			}
			if (!SignChannelTypeEnum.getCodes().contains(body.getSignTypeInfo().getContractObjectType())) {
				throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_PARAM_ILLEGAL, "主体形式: 值非法 - 参数校验失败");
			}
			//对公签约，只能选线下
			if (ContractObjectTypeEnum.COMPANY.getCode().equals(body.getSignTypeInfo().getContractObjectType())
				&& !SignChannelTypeEnum.OFFLINE.getCode().equals(body.getSignTypeInfo().getSignChannelType())) {
				throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_PARAM_ILLEGAL, "对公签约，只能选择线下签署 - 参数校验失败");
			}
			//线下校验 实际客户签署时间 && 实际盖公司章时间
			if (SignChannelTypeEnum.OFFLINE.getCode().equals(body.getSignTypeInfo().getSignChannelType())) {
				if (StringUtils.isBlank(body.getCompanySignTime())) {
					throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_PARAM_ILLEGAL, "实际盖公司章时间不能为空 - 参数校验失败");
				}
				if (StringUtils.isBlank(body.getUserSignTime())) {
					throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_PARAM_ILLEGAL, "实际客户签署时间不能为空 - 参数校验失败");
				}
			}
		}

		//签约信息
		if (partEnumList.contains(ZqContractPartEnum.SIGN_INFO)) {
			if (Objects.isNull(body.getSignInfo())) {
				throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_PARAM_ILLEGAL, "缺少签约人模块信息 - 参数校验失败");
			}
			//个人签约
			if (ContractObjectTypeEnum.PERSON.getCode().equals(body.getSignTypeInfo().getContractObjectType())) {
				//业主
				if (Objects.isNull(body.getSignInfo().getOwnerName())) {
					throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_PARAM_ILLEGAL, "业主姓名不能为空 - 参数校验失败");
				}
				if (Objects.isNull(body.getSignInfo().getOwnerPhone())) {
					throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_PARAM_ILLEGAL, "业主手机号不能为空 - 参数校验失败");
				}
				if (Objects.isNull(body.getSignInfo().getOwnerCertificateType())) {
					throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_PARAM_ILLEGAL, "业主证件类型不能为空 - 参数校验失败");
				}
				if (!CertificateTypeEnum.getCodes().contains(body.getSignInfo().getOwnerCertificateType())) {
					throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_PARAM_ILLEGAL, "业主证件类型: 值非法 - 参数校验失败");
				}
				if (StringUtils.isBlank(body.getSignInfo().getOwnerCertificateNo())) {
					throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_PARAM_ILLEGAL, "业主证件号不能为空 - 参数校验失败");
				}
				//校验信息一致性
				if (CertificateTypeEnum.ID.getCode().equals(body.getSignInfo().getOwnerCertificateType())) {
					if (!commonContractService.checkIdName(body.getSignInfo().getOwnerCertificateNo(), body.getSignInfo().getOwnerName())) {
						throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_BUSINESS, "客户姓名与身份证号不一致，请核对后重试");
					}
				}
				//代理人
				if (Objects.isNull(body.getSignInfo().getHaveAgent())) {
					throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_PARAM_ILLEGAL, "是否包含代理人不能为空 - 参数校验失败");
				}
				if (!CommonEnum.getCodes().contains(body.getSignInfo().getHaveAgent())) {
					throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_PARAM_ILLEGAL, "是否包含代理人：值非法 - 参数校验失败");
				}
				if (CommonEnum.YES.getCode().equals(body.getSignInfo().getHaveAgent())) {
					if (Objects.isNull(body.getSignInfo().getAgentName())) {
						throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_PARAM_ILLEGAL, "代理人姓名不能为空 - 参数校验失败");
					}
					if (Objects.isNull(body.getSignInfo().getAgentPhone())) {
						throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_PARAM_ILLEGAL, "代理人手机号不能为空 - 参数校验失败");
					}
					if (Objects.isNull(body.getSignInfo().getAgentCertificateType())) {
						throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_PARAM_ILLEGAL, "代理人证件类型不能为空 - 参数校验失败");
					}
					if (!CertificateTypeEnum.getCodes().contains(body.getSignInfo().getAgentCertificateType())) {
						throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_PARAM_ILLEGAL, "代理人证件类型: 值非法 - 参数校验失败");
					}
					if (StringUtils.isBlank(body.getSignInfo().getAgentCertificateNo())) {
						throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_PARAM_ILLEGAL, "代理人证件号不能为空 - 参数校验失败");
					}
					//校验信息一致性
					if (CertificateTypeEnum.ID.getCode().equals(body.getSignInfo().getAgentCertificateType())) {
						if (!commonContractService.checkIdName(body.getSignInfo().getAgentCertificateNo(), body.getSignInfo().getAgentName())) {
							throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_BUSINESS, "客户姓名与身份证号不一致，请核对后重试");
						}
					}
				}
			}
			//公司
			if (ContractObjectTypeEnum.COMPANY.getCode().equals(body.getSignTypeInfo().getContractObjectType())) {
				if (Objects.isNull(body.getSignInfo().getCompanyName())) {
					throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_PARAM_ILLEGAL, "企业名称不能为空 - 参数校验失败");
				}
				if (Objects.isNull(body.getSignInfo().getCompanyCreditCode())) {
					throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_PARAM_ILLEGAL, "统一社会信用代码不能为空 - 参数校验失败");
				}
				if (Objects.isNull(body.getSignInfo().getCompanyAgentName())) {
					throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_PARAM_ILLEGAL, "经办人姓名不能为空 - 参数校验失败");
				}
				if (!CertificateTypeEnum.getCodes().contains(body.getSignInfo().getCompanyAgentCertificateType())) {
					throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_PARAM_ILLEGAL, "经办人证件类型: 值非法 - 参数校验失败");
				}
				if (StringUtils.isBlank(body.getSignInfo().getCompanyAgentCertificateNo())) {
					throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_PARAM_ILLEGAL, "经办人证件号不能为空 - 参数校验失败");
				}
				//校验信息一致性
				if (CertificateTypeEnum.ID.getCode().equals(body.getSignInfo().getCompanyAgentCertificateType())) {
					if (!commonContractService.checkIdName(body.getSignInfo().getCompanyAgentCertificateNo(), body.getSignInfo().getCompanyAgentName())) {
						throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_BUSINESS, "客户姓名与身份证号不一致，请核对后重试");
					}
				}
			}
		}

		//项目信息
		if (partEnumList.contains(ZqContractPartEnum.PROJECT_INFO)) {
			ZqContractProjectDTO projectInfo = body.getProjectInfo();
			if (Objects.isNull(projectInfo)) {
				throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_PARAM_ILLEGAL, "缺少项目模块信息 - 参数校验失败");
			}
			if (Objects.isNull(projectInfo.getGbCode())) {
				throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_PARAM_ILLEGAL, "gbCode不能为空 - 参数校验失败");
			}
			if (Objects.isNull(projectInfo.getHouseBuildType())) {
				throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_PARAM_ILLEGAL, "户型结构不能为空 - 参数校验失败");
			}
			if (Objects.isNull(HouseBuildTypeEnum.getEnumByCode(projectInfo.getHouseType()))) {
				throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_PARAM_ILLEGAL, "户型结构: 值非法 - 参数校验失败");
			}
			if (Objects.isNull(projectInfo.getDistrictId()) || StringUtils.isBlank(projectInfo.getDistrictName())) {
				throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_PARAM_ILLEGAL, "行政区id&名称不能为空 - 参数校验失败");
			}
			if (StringUtils.isBlank(projectInfo.getResblockName())) {
				throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_PARAM_ILLEGAL, "小区名称不能为空 - 参数校验失败");
			}
			if (StringUtils.isBlank(projectInfo.getBuildingName())) {
				throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_PARAM_ILLEGAL, "楼栋名称不能为空 - 参数校验失败");
			}
			if (StringUtils.isBlank(projectInfo.getUnitName())) {
				throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_PARAM_ILLEGAL, "单元名称不能为空 - 参数校验失败");
			}
			if (StringUtils.isBlank(projectInfo.getFloorName())) {
				throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_PARAM_ILLEGAL, "楼层名称不能为空 - 参数校验失败");
			}
			if (StringUtils.isBlank(projectInfo.getHouseName())) {
				throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_PARAM_ILLEGAL, "房间名称不能为空 - 参数校验失败");
			}

			if (BusinessTypeEnum.getHouseCertificate25ModeList().contains(businessType)) {
				if (Objects.isNull(projectInfo.getArea())) {
					throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_PARAM_ILLEGAL, "建筑面积不能为空 - 参数校验失败");
				}
			}

			if (StringUtils.isEmpty(projectInfo.getPlanStartTime())) {
				throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_PARAM_ILLEGAL, "提交合同，计划开工日期不完整，校验失败-[签约]");
			}
			Integer houseType = projectInfo.getHouseType();
			if (Objects.isNull(houseType) || Objects.isNull(HouseTypeEnum.getEnumByCode(houseType))) {
				throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_PARAM_ILLEGAL, "提交合同，房屋类型信息不完整，校验失败-[签约]");
			}
			Integer houseBuildType = projectInfo.getHouseBuildType();
			if (Objects.isNull(houseBuildType) || Objects.isNull(HouseBuildTypeEnum.getEnumByCode(houseBuildType))) {
				throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_PARAM_ILLEGAL, "提交合同，房屋结构信息不完整，校验失败-[签约]");
			}
			//只有家装校验
			if (BusinessTypeEnum.HOUSE_CERTIFICATE.getCode().equals(businessType)) {
				if (commonContractService.needPeriodByHouseBuildType(houseBuildType) && Objects.isNull(projectInfo.getTotalDuration())) {
					throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_PARAM_ILLEGAL, "提交合同，总工期信息不完整，校验失败-[签约]");
				}
				if (Objects.isNull(projectInfo.getParlorCnt()) || Objects.isNull(projectInfo.getRoomCnt()) || Objects.isNull(projectInfo.getCookroomCnt()) || Objects.isNull(projectInfo.getToiletCnt()) || Objects.isNull(projectInfo.getBalconyCnt()) || Objects.isNull(projectInfo.getStorageCnt())) {
					throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_PARAM_ILLEGAL, "提交合同，户型信息不完整，校验失败-[签约]");
				}
				if (StringUtils.isEmpty(projectInfo.getArea())) {
					throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_PARAM_ILLEGAL, "提交合同，面积信息不完整，校验失败-[签约]");
				}

				//承包约定
				ZqPromiseInfoDTO zqPromiseInfoDTO = body.getPromiseInfo();
				if (Objects.isNull(zqPromiseInfoDTO.getClearDay()) || Objects.isNull(zqPromiseInfoDTO.getProjectContractModeCode())) {
					throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_PARAM_ILLEGAL, "提交合同，承包约定信息不完整，校验失败-[签约]");
				}
				if (Objects.isNull(zqPromiseInfoDTO.getConstructionDrawMode())) {
					throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_PARAM_ILLEGAL, "提交合同，承包约定双方商定施工图纸采取方式信息不完整，校验失败-[签约]");
				}
				if (Objects.isNull(zqPromiseInfoDTO.getNeedDesignerAmount())) {
					throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_PARAM_ILLEGAL, "提交合同，承包约定是否约定设计服务费信息不完整，校验失败-[签约]");
				}
				if (1 == zqPromiseInfoDTO.getNeedDesignerAmount() && Objects.isNull(zqPromiseInfoDTO.getAfterDiscountDesignerAmount())) {
					throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_PARAM_ILLEGAL, "提交合同，承包约定设计服务费（优惠后信息不完整，校验失败-[签约]");
				}
			} else if (BusinessTypeEnum.GROUP_DECORATE.getCode().equals(businessType)) {
				if (Objects.isNull(projectInfo.getTotalDurationEnum())) {
					throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_PARAM_ILLEGAL, "提交合同，总工期信息不完整，校验失败-[签约]");
				}
				if (Objects.isNull(projectInfo.getParlorCnt()) || Objects.isNull(projectInfo.getRoomCnt()) || Objects.isNull(projectInfo.getCookroomCnt()) || Objects.isNull(projectInfo.getToiletCnt()) || Objects.isNull(projectInfo.getBalconyCnt()) || Objects.isNull(projectInfo.getStorageCnt())) {
					throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_PARAM_ILLEGAL, "提交合同，户型信息不完整，校验失败-[签约]");
				}
				if (StringUtils.isEmpty(projectInfo.getArea())) {
					throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_PARAM_ILLEGAL, "提交合同，面积信息不完整，校验失败-[签约]");
				}
				//工程保修约定
				ZqGuaranteeDTO zqGuaranteeDTO = body.getGuaranteeInfo();
				if (Objects.isNull(zqGuaranteeDTO.getOtherGuaranteeYear())) {
					throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_PARAM_ILLEGAL, "提交合同，其他装修部位的保修期限不能为空，校验失败-[签约]");
				}
				if (Objects.isNull(zqGuaranteeDTO.getWaterProofGuaranteeYear())) {
					throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_PARAM_ILLEGAL, "提交合同，有防水要求的卫生间防渗漏工程保修期限不能为空，校验失败-[签约]");
				}
				if (Objects.isNull(zqGuaranteeDTO.getWaterElectricGuaranteeYear())) {
					throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_PARAM_ILLEGAL, "提交合同，对埋设在墙体、地面内的电气网络管线和给排水管道保修期限不能为空，校验失败-[签约]");
				}
				//承包约定
				ZqPromiseInfoDTO zqPromiseInfoDTO = body.getPromiseInfo();
				if (Objects.isNull(zqPromiseInfoDTO.getBeforeDeliveryDaysToWork())) {
					throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_PARAM_ILLEGAL, "提交合同，甲方须在开发商统一交房通知开工不能为空，校验失败-[签约]");
				}
			}
		}

		//承包约定
		if (partEnumList.contains(ZqContractPartEnum.PROMISE_INFO)) {
			//只有家装校验
			if (BusinessTypeEnum.getHouseCertificate25ModeList().contains(businessType)) {
				//承包约定
				ZqPromiseInfoDTO zqPromiseInfoDTO = body.getPromiseInfo();
				if (Objects.isNull(zqPromiseInfoDTO.getClearDay()) || Objects.isNull(zqPromiseInfoDTO.getProjectContractModeCode())) {
					throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_PARAM_ILLEGAL, "提交合同，承包约定信息不完整，校验失败-[签约]");
				}
				if (Objects.isNull(zqPromiseInfoDTO.getConstructionDrawMode())) {
					throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_PARAM_ILLEGAL, "提交合同，承包约定双方商定施工图纸采取方式信息不完整，校验失败-[签约]");
				}
				if (Objects.isNull(zqPromiseInfoDTO.getNeedDesignerAmount())) {
					throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_PARAM_ILLEGAL, "提交合同，承包约定是否约定设计服务费信息不完整，校验失败-[签约]");
				}
				if (1 == zqPromiseInfoDTO.getNeedDesignerAmount() && Objects.isNull(zqPromiseInfoDTO.getAfterDiscountDesignerAmount())) {
					throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_PARAM_ILLEGAL, "提交合同，承包约定设计服务费（优惠后信息不完整，校验失败-[签约]");
				}
			}
		}

		//保修
		if (partEnumList.contains(ZqContractPartEnum.PROMISE_INFO)) {
			if (BusinessTypeEnum.GROUP_DECORATE.getCode().equals(businessType)) {
				//工程保修约定
				ZqGuaranteeDTO zqGuaranteeDTO = body.getGuaranteeInfo();
				if (Objects.isNull(zqGuaranteeDTO.getOtherGuaranteeYear())) {
					throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_PARAM_ILLEGAL, "提交合同，其他装修部位的保修期限不能为空，校验失败-[签约]");
				}
				if (Objects.isNull(zqGuaranteeDTO.getWaterProofGuaranteeYear())) {
					throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_PARAM_ILLEGAL, "提交合同，有防水要求的卫生间防渗漏工程保修期限不能为空，校验失败-[签约]");
				}
				if (Objects.isNull(zqGuaranteeDTO.getWaterElectricGuaranteeYear())) {
					throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_PARAM_ILLEGAL, "提交合同，对埋设在墙体、地面内的电气网络管线和给排水管道保修期限不能为空，校验失败-[签约]");
				}
				//承包约定
				ZqPromiseInfoDTO zqPromiseInfoDTO = body.getPromiseInfo();
				if (Objects.isNull(zqPromiseInfoDTO.getBeforeDeliveryDaysToWork())) {
					throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_PARAM_ILLEGAL, "提交合同，甲方须在开发商统一交房通知开工不能为空，校验失败-[签约]");
				}
			}
		}
	}


	public StartQuotaDTO getCalendar(String projectOrderId, Integer gbCode, Long resblockId, String address, Byte contractType) {
		Long designerUcId = null;

		ServiceProviderDTO designer = commonContractService.getDesignerInfo(projectOrderId);
		if (Objects.nonNull(designer)) {
			designerUcId = designer.getUcId();
		}

		StartQuotaDTO startQuotaDTO = null;
		LOGGER.info("获取产能日历：projectOrderId {} gbCode:{} designerUcId:{} resblockId:{} address:{}", projectOrderId,
			gbCode, designerUcId, resblockId, address);
		startQuotaDTO = quotaCalenderFeignService.listStartWorkQuota(projectOrderId,
			String.valueOf(gbCode), designerUcId, resblockId, address, CapacitySourceTypeEnum.contractTypeMapSourceType(contractType));
		if (Objects.isNull(startQuotaDTO) || CollectionUtils.isEmpty((startQuotaDTO.getStartsQuotaCalendarDTOS()))) {
			throw new UtopiaBussinessException(ResultCodeEnum.ERROR_PARAM_ILLEGAL, "调取产能数据失败，可先任选开工时间进行签约！");
		}
		return startQuotaDTO;
	}

	@Deprecated
	public ZqContractDetailResp getZqContractDetail(String projectOrderId, Byte type, String contractCode, Boolean isDetail) {
		Contract contract = null;
		if (StringUtils.isNotBlank(contractCode)) {
			contract = contractService.getByContractCode(contractCode);
